{'symbol': 'FMC', 'date': '2023-03-08 08:30:00', 'title': "FMC CORPORATION MAKES BARRON'S 100 MOST SUSTAINABLE U.S COMPANIES LIST FOR SECOND CONSECUTIVE YEAR", 'text': "PHILADELPHIA , MARCH 8, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- FMC CORPORATION (NYSE: FMC), A LEADING GLOBAL AGRICULTURAL SCIENCES COMPANY, HAS MADE BARRON'S ANNUAL LIST OF THE 100 MOST SUSTAINABLE U.S. COMPANIES. FOR THE SECOND CONSECUTIVE YEAR FMC IS THE ONLY AGRICULTURE COMPANY TO MAKE THE LIST, MOVING UP IN THE RANKING EIGHT PLACES TO 64."}